### Reminder API scenario: a repeating promise, a one-off task, done, snooze and the refused cases.
### Run the requests top to bottom (VS Code REST Client or Rider HTTP Client).
### Fill the two seed account values from user-secrets: Seed:SahipEmail / Seed:SahipPassword
### (and Seed:AsistanEmail / Seed:AsistanPassword for the 403 example). Do not commit real values.

@host = http://localhost:5051
@sahipEmail = <Seed:SahipEmail>
@sahipSifre = <Seed:SahipPassword>
@asistanEmail = <Seed:AsistanEmail>
@asistanSifre = <Seed:AsistanPassword>

# Client-made ids (Guid v7 style), so every POST below can be repeated safely.
@dogumGunuId = 019e2000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001
@gorevId = 019e2000-0000-7000-8000-000000000002

### 1. Log in as Sahip
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/hesap/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{sahipEmail}}", "password": "{{sahipSifre}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. A yearly special date with a 3-day heads-up -> 201 (again with the same id -> 200)
POST {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{dogumGunuId}}",
  "baslik": "Annemin doğum günü",
  "tur": "ozelTarih",
  "gun": "2026-12-15",
  "tekrar": "yillik",
  "onceGun": 3
}

### 3. A one-off task at 17:30 -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{gorevId}}",
  "baslik": "Faturayı öde",
  "tur": "gorev",
  "gun": "2026-11-10",
  "saat": "17:30:00"
}

### 4. A promise to someone, repeating on the 31st (a short month ends on its last day)
POST {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "baslik": "Ali'ye kitabı geri ver", "tur": "soz", "kime": "Ali", "gun": "2026-11-30", "tekrar": "aylik" }

### 5. List: all, open ones due within 7 days, closed ones
GET {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar?yaklasan=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar?durum=tamam
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. One reminder
GET {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar/{{gorevId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Edit (clears a snooze, recomputes the next moment)
PUT {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar/{{gorevId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "baslik": "Faturayı öde", "tur": "gorev", "gun": "2026-11-12", "saat": "18:00:00" }

### 8. Snooze one hour, or until tomorrow at the reminder's hour
POST {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar/{{gorevId}}/ertele
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sure": "1s" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar/{{gorevId}}/ertele
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sure": "yarin" }

### 9. Done: a one-off becomes "tamam", a repeating one moves to its next turn
POST {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar/{{gorevId}}/yaptim
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Refused: no title and an unknown snooze -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "baslik": "", "gun": "2026-11-10" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar/{{dogumGunuId}}/ertele
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sure": "2s" }

### 10a. A persistent, urgent reminder (H4): the phone re-notifies every israrAraligiDakika (5, 15 or 60) minutes,
### at most israrEnCok (1-4) times, until done or snoozed. The server only stores the fields.
POST {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "baslik": "İlacı al", "gun": "2026-11-10", "saat": "08:00:00", "israrli": true, "israrAraligiDakika": 5, "israrEnCok": 4, "acil": true }

### 10b. Refused: an interval other than 5, 15, 60 and a count above 4 -> 400 { errors: { israrAraligiDakika, israrEnCok } }
POST {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "baslik": "Olmaz", "gun": "2026-11-10", "israrli": true, "israrAraligiDakika": 10, "israrEnCok": 5 }

### 11. Delete -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar/{{gorevId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. The Asistan without the hatirlatici.oku permission -> 403
# @name asistanLogin
POST {{host}}/api/hesap/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{asistanEmail}}", "password": "{{asistanSifre}}" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/hatirlaticilar
Authorization: Bearer {{asistanLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
